Package: replayr
Title: Import Emulator Input Recordings
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Thorben", "Pelzer", , "thorben@pelzer.blog",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Import emulator input recordings from 'FCEUX', 'BizHawk',
    'Dolphin', 'Citra', 'libTAS', 'openMSX', 'JPC-RR', and other recording
    tools. Imports retain compact digital control arrays, stable control
    identities, original numeric channels, metadata, and emulator commands.
    Supports gamepads, keyboards, mice, touchscreens, and recorded motion
    or light-gun channels. Source timing distinguishes frames, controller
    polls, and timestamped events. Left and right stick directions, angles,
    and magnitudes can be selected independently. Allows analysis of input
    recordings without running an emulator.
